From: Rodrigo Goya <rodrigo.goya@abcellera.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:05:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] rnaview: give process_3d_fig a full prototype

C23 (the default in GCC 15) treats an empty parameter list as "no
arguments", so the call in rnaview.c with eleven arguments becomes a
hard error. Copy the signature from the definition in vrml.c.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 vmd/plugins/rnaview/src/rna_header.h | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/vmd/plugins/rnaview/src/rna_header.h b/vmd/plugins/rnaview/src/rna_header.h
index 169a326..f40652a 100644
--- a/vmd/plugins/rnaview/src/rna_header.h
+++ b/vmd/plugins/rnaview/src/rna_header.h
